      "message": "test: cover HTTP connection slot exhaustion by unfinished requests\n\nFill every slot with clients that complete one request and then start a second one they never finish, and check that a client connecting behind them still gets served.  Reclaiming the slot has to run from the first byte of the unfinished request, not the last, or trickling would push the reclaiming back forever.",
